	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a moment’s preparation and a smirk, you can do with ease what makes others sweat with effort. As a bonus action, you take up the stance, gaining advantage to hit small targets with predictable trajectories or perform non combat tricks like snuffing out a line of candles with a bullet. Deal double damage to ropes, buttons, chains, locks, and other bindings without harming bound targets or people wearing the buttons, so long as you use a firearm.</p>",
